  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Xenovader\u25b3 of Blue Tuonela",
      "effect": "If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: Banish (face-down) the top 3 cards of your Deck. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Xenovader\u25b3 of Blue Tuonela\" once per turn. If this card is in your hand and your opponent controls more monsters than you do: You can Special Summon this card. During your Main Phase: You can Special Summon 1 of your face-down banished Level 5 or higher \"Xenovader\u25b3\" monsters, also you cannot activate cards or effects for the rest of this turn, except \"Xenovader\u25b3\" cards or effects.",
      "official": false
    },
